### Dashboard UI
#### [NEW] [DashboardApp.tsx](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/dashboard/components/DashboardApp.tsx)

Layout:
- **Header**: "📊 CEO Dashboard" + greeting
- **Row 1**: 4 KPI cards lớn (Doanh thu, Chi phí, Headcount, Quỹ lương)
- **Row 2**: 3 panels — Invoice breakdown (paid/pending), Workforce status, CRM clients
- **Row 3**: Payroll summary (latest sheet), HR departments headcount

Style: dark theme matching app, gradient cards, animated counters.

